<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/industrial-iot">Industrial &amp; IoT</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">IoT Device Assembly</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Industrial &amp; IoT products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/pcba-box-build"><span class="abbr">PB</span><span class="label">PCBA &amp; Box Build</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly"><span class="abbr">ID</span><span class="label">IoT Device Assembly</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/industrial-iot/rfid-asset-tracking"><span class="abbr">RT</span><span class="label">RFID Asset Tracking</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the product does and where it runs and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Industrial &amp; IoT &middot; IoT Device Assembly</div><h1 class="mk-h1">IoT device assembly — from PCBA to complete product</h1><p class="mk-lede">Connected-device manufacturing brings the PCBA, wireless module, antenna, sensors, battery and mechanical assembly together in one finished product. Hana supports this complete assembly process, including functional and wireless test at finished-unit level.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-iot-device-assembly" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ IoT Device Assembly &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-iot-device-assembly" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana assembles complete connected devices, including PCBA with embedded wireless modules, antenna and sensor integration, battery and harness assembly, enclosure fitting and final mechanical assembly. Functional and wireless testing can be performed on the complete assembled product, with in-house test capability covering multiple wireless standards.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Complete connected devices</span></div><div class="desc">PCBA, wireless modules, sensors, battery and enclosure assembled and tested as one complete product.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Board, radio and antenna integration</span></div><div class="desc">PCBA with embedded wireless modules, antenna integration and sensor assembly within the same manufacturing program.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Enclosure, cable and harness assembly</span></div><div class="desc">Cable and harness assembly, enclosure fitting and final mechanical assembly around the completed board.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Wireless functional test</span></div><div class="desc">In-house test capability for 802.11 embedded wireless modules, GSM/cellular, GPS, Bluetooth and acoustic functions, selected according to program requirements.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See PCBA &amp; Box Build for the wider manufacturing process, from SMT assembly through final product integration, configuration and packout.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build/box-build">Explore Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Finished-product functional and wireless test</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">Wireless performance can change once the radio, antenna, battery, enclosure and surrounding mechanical components are integrated into the finished product. Hana can therefore perform wireless functional testing at assembled-device level. In-house capability includes 802.11 embedded modules, GSM/cellular, GPS, Bluetooth and acoustic testing. Pilot and pre-production builds can also be used to establish the assembly sequence, fixtures and test coverage before volume production.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">PCBA and box build</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">PCBA and box build</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><div class="note">final assembly, cable and harness</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana assemble my whole IoT device, not just the PCB?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Box build covers the radio, sensors, battery, cable and harness, and the enclosure and mechanical parts around the board, assembled and functionally tested as one finished unit before it ships.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How can Hana test a wireless product before it ships?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Wireless functional testing can be performed on the assembled device. In-house capability covers 802.11 embedded modules, GSM and cellular, GPS, Bluetooth and acoustic test, with the test set selected according to program requirements.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana support a pilot build before volume production?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Pilot and pre-production builds can be run ahead of volume so the assembly sequence, fixtures and test coverage are proven on real units first.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/industrial-iot" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Industrial &amp; IoT market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your connected-device program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>